## Visual and editorial rules

Use Manrope for display and Inter for body/UI. Use the approved dark/light green foundation with restrained light yellow and purple accents. The Boardroom Editorial system is clear by default and dark by intention: light surfaces carry explanation, reading, diagnosis, forms, articles, and legal content; dark surfaces mark recognition, integrated prophetic differentiation, Blueprint emphasis, and selective action.

No founder photograph is used. Kingdom Wealth & Impact is visibly in development and must not look fully available. Use no religious clichés, literal flames, mystical spectacle, stock consulting scenes, fake dashboards, fake documents, glowing nodes, translucent glass cards, decorative connector networks, or image without a communication job.

## Bilingual requirement

English and Latin American/Colombian Spanish are first-class experiences. Use the approved V3 Spanish copy, route map, slugs, labels, metadata, and CTA parity. Do not mechanically translate, force English line breaks, or make Spanish artificially more religious. URL language is the source of truth.

## Protected architecture

Preserve the existing Bolt.new → GitHub → Cloudflare Pages → companyofprofits.com architecture. Sanity remains the Insights CMS. Supabase remains the application backend. 

## Execution discipline

Each phase is gated. Report files modified, actual token use, tests run, failures, and current recoverable state. Respect the phase ceiling and stop near 80% of it if acceptance is not achieved. Never silently expand scope. Never proceed past a protected-functionality regression.